<title>HUNGARY: Soproni group 9-month operating profit HUF 767.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Soproni group 9-month operating profit HUF 767.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-Sept 1996     Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	767.8	vs    393.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  695.9	vs    349.3</p>
<p>    Group net sales	    11,364.2	vs  4,188.5</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   108.2	vs     47.4</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     8,514.5	vs  2,788.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	698.2	vs    383.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    435.7	vs    239.4</p>
<p>    Other costs		     728.9	vs    328.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    399.6	vs    129.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   92.4 loss vs    58.8 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    28.4	vs    37.7</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures    120.8	vs    96.5</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income     20.6 profit vs  14.4 profit</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	71.2	vs    33.6</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditures 50.6	vs    19.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Soproni Sorgyar Rt is a brewery.</p>
<p>The 1996 figures are consolidated, while the 1995 figures are not consolidated. -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
